      "graph": "collision",
      "classification": "edge-case",
      "description": "Lane writer `next` and alice-owned strand `next` both mint dot `next:1` (lane:1 and strand:1). The legacy key collides; the v21 keys @w.next and @w.alice@s.next do not, so the duplicate scan must run after re-keying.",
